       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FINANCE-PROJECTION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MONTH                  PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-BALANCE-CENTS          PIC S9(15) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-MONTHLY-NET-CENTS      PIC S9(15) VALUE 0.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-START-BALANCE-CENTS    PIC S9(15).
       01  LK-MONTHLY-INCOME-CENTS   PIC S9(15).
       01  LK-MONTHLY-EXPENSE-CENTS  PIC S9(15).
       01  LK-MONTHS                 PIC 99.
       01  LK-END-BALANCE-CENTS      PIC S9(15).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
           LK-START-BALANCE-CENTS
           LK-MONTHLY-INCOME-CENTS
           LK-MONTHLY-EXPENSE-CENTS
           LK-MONTHS
           LK-END-BALANCE-CENTS.

           MOVE LK-START-BALANCE-CENTS TO WS-BALANCE-CENTS
           COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-NET-CENTS =
               LK-MONTHLY-INCOME-CENTS -
               LK-MONTHLY-EXPENSE-CENTS

           PERFORM VARYING WS-MONTH FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-MONTH > LK-MONTHS
               ADD WS-MONTHLY-NET-CENTS TO WS-BALANCE-CENTS
           END-PERFORM

           MOVE WS-BALANCE-CENTS TO LK-END-BALANCE-CENTS
           GOBACK.
